 "_readme": {
  "what": "Every Form D filed by an 8VC vehicle in the investor's own EDGAR registry whose name matches config.profile.own_vehicle_pattern. Written by scratch/fund-formds-pull.py; COLLECTION.md §11 requires this file and says nothing else writes it.",
  "why_not_the_sweep": "sources/edgar/formd-sweep.json is the ROSTER sweep — Form Ds carrying an 8VC person as a related person, i.e. portfolio issuers. The firm's own vehicles are a different set and are pulled here by CIK.",
  "filing_style": "8VC's flagship L.P.s and its SPVs file 'Indefinite' offerings, most of them at $0 sold, so the §11 $0-sold cross-check against a total-offering amount does NOT apply to this firm: an entry carrying an accession is asserted against the filed sold amount, and fund sizes come from press or the ADV Section 7.B.",
  "vehicles": 80
 }
}